 "description": "Perform a bounded, passive technical website inspection covering measurable SEO, performance, accessibility, security, UX and crawlability indicators; unavailable checks are reported honestly. Use when an agent needs evidence-backed website issues from a public HTTPS URL before estimating remediation or rebuild work. Selection: primary; prefer for passive technical, SEO, accessibility and security checks for a public HTTPS site.",
